ASM990 2.4.6     CALL                       Sun Aug 10 23:07:32 2025 Page 0001
CALL HANDLER - CORTEX BASIC REV. 1.1

              2         IDT  'CALL'
              3  *      
              4  *      CALL HANDLER
              5  *
              6         DEF  CLLY
              7         REF  EVSDZ
              8         REF  NLIN
              9         REF  CALLWP,CALL12
     2F80    10  ERROR  EQU  >2F80
             11         DXOP EVFIX,11
             12  *
             13  * CALL COMMAND
             14  *
             15  *   CALL "ROUTINE",ADDRESS,PARMS.....,PARMS
             16  *
             17  * THE ROUTINE NAME FIELD IS OPTIONAL
             18  * PARMS (UPTO 12) ARE SEPARATED BY COMMAS
             19  * THESE ARE STORED IN THE USER'S REGISTERS R0 - R11;
             20  * R12 CONTAINS THE NUMBER OF ARGUMENTS PASSED OVER.
             21  *
             22  * PARMS SHOULD BE EITHER:
             23  *      INTEGER VALUES/EXPRESSIONS   OR
             24  *      THE ADDRESS OF THE VARIABLE/ARRAY ELEMENT
             25  *      CONTAINING THE DESIRED PARAMETER.
             26  *
             27  * THE ADDRESS OF X IS PASSED BY  -  ADR(X)
ASM990 2.4.6     CALL                       Sun Aug 10 23:07:32 2025 Page 0002
CALL HANDLER - CORTEX BASIC REV. 1.1

             29  *
             30  * SET UP THE BLWP VECTOR IN R4,R5 FOR THE USER'S PROG
             31  *
0000 020C    32  CLLY   LI   R12,CALLWP        REF "USER'S" WORKSPACE
0002 0000 
0004 020B    33         LI   R11,CALL12        REF LAST+1 USEABLE REGISTER
0006 0000 
0008 0420    34         BLWP @EVSDZ            ALLOW STRING CONSTANT
000A 0000 
000C 1001    35         JMP  GETPC             OK, STRING CONSTANT  ("---")
000E 2F81    36         DATA ERROR+1           WRONG, STRING VARIABLE  ($VAR)
             37  *                             NEITHER, DROP THROUGH TO GETPC
0010 04C2    38  GETPC  CLR  R2                RESET COUNT
0012 C10C    39         MOV  R12,R4            SET CALLVEC'S WP
0014 2EC5    40         EVFIX R5               GET PC
0016 0280    41  CLL2   CI   R0,>3F00          PARAMETERS?
0018 3F00 
001A 1604    42         JNE  CLL4              N, EXIT TO USER ROUTINE
001C 0582    43         INC  R2                Y, INCREMENT COUNT
001E 2EFC    44  CLL2A  EVFIX *R12+            STUFF NEXT ARGUMENT INTO REGISTER
0020 82CC    45         C    R12,R11           REGISTER'S FULL?
0022 1AF9    46         JL   CLL2              N - BACK FOR NEXT ARGUMENT
             47  *
             48  * ALL ARGUMENTS HAVE BEEN STORED IN THE REGISTERS
             49  * (OR ALL THAT ARE GOING TO BE HANDLED)
             50  *
0024 C6C2    51  CLL4   MOV  R2,*R11           SAVE COUNT IN USER'S R12
0026 0404    52         BLWP R4                BLWP TO USER'S ROUTINE
0028 0460    53         B    @NLIN             RETURNS TO HERE
002A 0000 
             54         END
